Uka maranakansti Watch Tower Bible and Tract Society sat corporacionan directoranakampi oraqpachan jilïr irpirinakampejj pachpakïnwa . 1971 maranwa , Oraqpachan Jilïr Irpirinakampi Sociedad Watch Tower sarayir directoranakampi jan kikpätapajj qhanstäna , Sociedad Watch Tower sat sutejj leyinakarjam uñtʼatäñatakïnwa .
